request.description:
**Lister les fournisseurs OAuth disponibles**

Retourne la liste des fournisseurs OAuth configurés.

**Pas d'authentification requise**

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "providers": [
            {
                "name": "google",
                "displayName": "Google",
                "enabled": true
            },
            {
                "name": "github",
                "displayName": "GitHub",
                "enabled": true
            },
            {
                "name": "keycloak",
                "displayName": "SSO Entreprise",
                "enabled": false
            }
        ]
    }
}
```

**Initier la connexion GitHub OAuth**

Retourne l'URL d'autorisation GitHub.

**Pas d'authentification requise**

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "authorizationUrl": "https://github.com/login/oauth/authorize?...",
        "state": "random-state-string"
    }
}
```

**Callback GitHub OAuth**

Échange le code d'autorisation GitHub contre des tokens.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "code": "authorization_code_from_github"
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...",
        "refreshToken": "a1b2c3d4e5f6...",
        "user": {...}
    }
}
```

**Callback Keycloak SSO**

Échange le code d'autorisation Keycloak.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "code": "authorization_code_from_keycloak"
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...",
        "refreshToken": "a1b2c3d4e5f6...",
        "user": {...}
    }
}
```

**Créer un nouveau workspace**

Crée un espace de travail et définit l'utilisateur comme propriétaire.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
```

**Body:**
```json
{
    "name": "Mon Entreprise",
    "description": "Workspace principal"
}
```

**Réponse (201):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Mon Entreprise",
        "code": "WS_ABC123",
        "owner": {...}
    }
}
```

**Lister les workspaces de l'utilisateur**

Retourne tous les workspaces dont l'utilisateur est membre.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "Mon Entreprise",
            "role": "owner",
            "memberCount": 5
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "name": "Projet Client",
            "role": "member",
            "memberCount": 3
        }
    ]
}
```

**Changer de workspace actif**

Définit le workspace actif pour l'utilisateur.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Workspace switched successfully",
    "data": {
        "currentWorkspace": {...}
    }
}
```

**Note:** Les requêtes suivantes utiliseront ce workspace

**Rechercher des contacts**

Recherche rapide par nom, email ou téléphone.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**URL:** `/contact/search/{terme}`
- Exemple: `/contact/search/dupont`

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "firstname": "Jean",
            "lastname": "Dupont",
            "email": "jean.dupont@example.com"
        }
    ]
}
```

**Lister les contacts avec pagination**

Retourne la liste paginée des contacts du workspace.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**Body:**
```json
{
    "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25
    },
    "filters": {
        "search": "dupont",
        "company_id": 5,
        "tags": [1, 2]
    },
    "sort": {
        "field": "lastname",
        "order": "ASC"
    }
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [...],
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 25,
    "total": 150
}
```

**Fusionner deux contacts**

Fusionne le contact source dans le contact cible.

**Comportement:**
- Les données du source complètent le target
- Les relations (deals, activities) sont transférées
- Le contact source est supprimé

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Contacts merged successfully",
    "data": {
        "mergedContact": {...}
    }
}
```

**Lister les activités**

**Body:**
```json
{
    "filters": {
        "type": "call",
        "contact_id": 5,
        "from": "2025-01-01",
        "to": "2025-12-31"
    }
}
```

**Types:** call, meeting, email, task, note

**Lister toutes les étapes de pipeline**

Retourne toutes les étapes de tous les pipelines du workspace.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "Prospection",
            "position": 1,
            "probability": 10,
            "pipeline": {"id": 1, "name": "Sales"}
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "name": "Qualification",
            "position": 2,
            "probability": 25,
            "pipeline": {"id": 1, "name": "Sales"}
        }
    ]
}
```

**Modifier les métadonnées d'un fichier**

Met à jour les informations d'un fichier (nom, description, tags).

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**Body:**
```json
{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Nouveau nom",
    "description": "Description mise à jour",
    "tags": [1, 2, 3]
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {...}
}
```

**Lister les adresses email**

Retourne toutes les adresses email associées à une entité (contact ou entreprise).

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**Query params:**
- `entity_type`: contact ou company
- `entity_id`: ID de l'entité

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [
        {"id": 1, "email": "pro@example.com", "type": "work", "isPrimary": true},
        {"id": 2, "email": "perso@example.com", "type": "personal", "isPrimary": false}
    ]
}
```

**Lister les numéros de téléphone**

Retourne tous les numéros associés à une entité.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**Query params:**
- `entity_type`: contact ou company
- `entity_id`: ID de l'entité

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [
        {"id": 1, "number": "+33612345678", "type": "mobile", "isPrimary": true},
        {"id": 2, "number": "+33123456789", "type": "office", "isPrimary": false}
    ]
}
```

**Détails d'un numéro de téléphone**

**URL:** `/phone/number/{id}`

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "number": "+33612345678",
        "type": "mobile",
        "isPrimary": true,
        "contact": {...}
    }
}
```

**Lister les modèles de propriétés**

Modèles prédéfinis pour créer rapidement des propriétés.

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": [
        {"id": 1, "name": "Industrie", "type": "select"},
        {"id": 2, "name": "Taille entreprise", "type": "select"},
        {"id": 3, "name": "Budget", "type": "number"}
    ]
}
```

**Valider une ligne de contact**

Valide les données d'un contact avant insertion.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "firstname": "Jean",
    "lastname": "Dupont",
    "email": "jean@example.com",
    "phone": "+33612345678"
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "valid": true,
        "errors": [],
        "normalized": {
            "phone": "+33 6 12 34 56 78"
        }
    }
}
```

**Valider une ligne d'entreprise**

Valide les données d'une entreprise avant insertion.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "name": "Tech Corp",
    "website": "techcorp.com",
    "industry": "Technology"
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "valid": true,
        "normalized": {
            "website": "https://techcorp.com"
        }
    }
}
```

**Détecter les doublons de contacts**

Vérifie si des contacts similaires existent déjà.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "contacts": [
        {"email": "jean@example.com", "firstname": "Jean", "lastname": "Dupont"},
        {"email": "marie@example.com", "firstname": "Marie", "lastname": "Martin"}
    ]
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "duplicates": [
            {
                "index": 0,
                "matches": [{"id": 5, "email": "jean@example.com", "similarity": 100}]
            }
        ],
        "unique": [1]
    }
}
```

**Détecter les doublons d'entreprises**

Vérifie si des entreprises similaires existent déjà.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "companies": [
        {"name": "Tech Corp", "website": "techcorp.com"},
        {"name": "New Company"}
    ]
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "duplicates": [...],
        "unique": [1]
    }
}
```

**Détails d'un plan**

**URL:** `/api/plans/{code}`
- Exemple: `/api/plans/pro`

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "code": "pro",
        "name": "Pro",
        "price": 29,
        "limits": {
            "contacts": -1,
            "users": 5,
            "storage": "10GB"
        },
        "features": [...]
    }
}
```

**Comparer les plans**

Affiche un tableau comparatif de tous les plans.

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "features": [
            {"name": "Contacts", "free": "100", "pro": "Illimité", "enterprise": "Illimité"},
            {"name": "Utilisateurs", "free": "1", "pro": "5", "enterprise": "Illimité"}
        ]
    }
}
```

**Obtenir l'abonnement actuel**

Retourne les détails de l'abonnement du workspace.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
X-Workspace-Id: {workspace_id}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "plan": "pro",
        "status": "active",
        "currentPeriodStart": "2025-01-01",
        "currentPeriodEnd": "2025-02-01",
        "cancelAtPeriodEnd": false,
        "usage": {
            "contacts": 450,
            "users": 3
        }
    }
}
```

**S'abonner à un plan**

Crée un nouvel abonnement.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "planCode": "pro",
    "billingCycle": "monthly",
    "paymentMethodId": "pm_xxx"
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "subscriptionId": "sub_xxx",
        "status": "active"
    }
}
```

**Changer de plan**

Upgrade ou downgrade du plan actuel.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "newPlanCode": "enterprise",
    "immediate": true
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Plan changed successfully",
    "data": {
        "effectiveDate": "2025-01-15",
        "prorata": 15.50
    }
}
```

**Voir l'utilisation actuelle**

Statistiques d'utilisation par rapport aux limites du plan.

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "contacts": {"used": 450, "limit": -1, "percentage": null},
        "users": {"used": 3, "limit": 5, "percentage": 60},
        "storage": {"used": "2.5GB", "limit": "10GB", "percentage": 25}
    }
}
```

**Recherche pour synchronisation**

Recherche un contact pour la synchronisation externe.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "email": "jean@example.com",
    "externalId": "ext_123"
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "found": true,
        "contact": {...}
    }
}
```

**Synchroniser un contact**

Crée ou met à jour un contact depuis une source externe.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "externalId": "ext_123",
    "source": "hubspot",
    "data": {
        "firstname": "Jean",
        "lastname": "Dupont",
        "email": "jean@example.com"
    }
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {
        "action": "created",
        "contact": {...}
    }
}
```

**Récupérer données d'un formulaire**

Traite les soumissions de formulaires web.

**Body:**
```json
{
    "formId": "contact-form",
    "data": {
        "name": "Jean Dupont",
        "email": "jean@example.com",
        "message": "Je suis intéressé..."
    }
}
```

**Modifier son profil**

Met à jour le profil de l'utilisateur connecté.

**Headers requis:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {jwt_token}
```

**Body:**
```json
{
    "firstname": "Jean-Pierre",
    "lastname": "Dupont",
    "preferences": {
        "language": "fr",
        "timezone": "Europe/Paris",
        "notifications": {
            "email": true,
            "push": false
        }
    }
}
```

**Réponse (200):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "data": {...}
}
```
